{"sba-hinata-22143":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n \n こんにちは꒰⑅ᵕ༚ᵕ꒱˖♡\n \n 佐々木美玲です！！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ10HDVRHY51GSKA1N7H9N6H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 昨日は、「炎の体育会TV」見てくれましたか？？\n 知ってくれている方もいらっしゃるかも知れませんが、私たちのキャプテン菅井友香さんの応援に行ってきました( •ᴗ•)*♪\n \n \n \n \n \n 初めて、目の前でお馬さんを見て、そして競技を見てすごくすごくカッコよかったです(^^♪\n \n \n \n \n お馬さん本当に可愛いなと思いました。\n 見てるうちにルールも分かってきて夢中になって見ていましたଘ(੭ˊ꒳​ˋ)੭✧\n \n \n \n \n 陰ながらですが、応援に行かせていただけて本当に楽しかったし菅井さんとキシオくんカッコよかったです。\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ10HEW767H7ZEJXCPPGN72H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 本当にかっこよかったな〜ଘ(੭ˊ꒳​ˋ)੭✧\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ10HFW524ESRB0PHRT2H0GG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n そしてそして夜には欅坂46SHOWで「僕たちは付き合っている」もテレビ初公開で披露させていただきました！！\n \n \n \n \n ちなみに私たちはこの歌のこと略して「僕ってる」って呼んでいます(^^♪\n \n \n \n \n すごく大好きな曲なのでいろんな方に聴いて頂けたらな、見て頂けたらな〜って思います(*ﾟｰﾟ)v\n \n \n \n \n \n 見てくださったみなさんも\n \n ありがとうございます(*ˊ˘ˋ*)｡♪:*°\n \n \n \n \n \n それじゃあこの辺で\n \n 明日からまた1週間頑張るぞ〜꒰⑅ᵕ༚ᵕ꒱˖♡\n \n \n \n \n \n ＊佐々木美玲＊"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-9288":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/19/1364396/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うちの愛犬くん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/19/1364396/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/19/1364396/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/19/1364396/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/19/1364396/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モフモフ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、センター試験はもう受けたかな？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/19/1364396/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の問題はこの子の名前っ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/19/1364396/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は、この子が井上家にきて、\nだんだん仲良くなっていくうちに\nみんなあだ名で呼ぶようになったのですが、\nもともとペットショップでつけられていた\nちゃんとしたお名前があるんです！>_<"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみになぜ、さゆにゃんが\n喋っていないのかというと..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んんんん>_<"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これもクイズに出てくるかも？！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、問題にこたえて\nプレゼントゲットしてね(o^^o)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/19/1364396/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前に言ってた、色んな撮影で早く届けばいいなってのがコレのことっ☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"制服のマネキンだけに、いろいろな\n制服を着て撮影したので、\nみんな見てねっ（＾ω＾）！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://www.nogizaka46.com/center/questions.html"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/19/1364396/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして本日は、発売日です！＼(^o^)／おめでとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/m